3. This duration (100ms) is also shorter than the shortest FIFO/LIFO timeout (250ms), ensuring that no thread times out and changes its state prematurely before the assertion.

This ensures that when the assertion is checked, all relevant thread states are correctly `FIFO_TEST_START` (or `LIFO_TEST_START`), indicating they are pending on the FIFO/LIFO as expected.

